<title>SYRIA: Syria offers 50,000 tonnes of wheat for sale.</title>
<headline>Syria offers 50,000 tonnes of wheat for sale.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) has offered 50,000 tonnes of hard durum amber wheat for sale, a company spokesman said on friday.</p>
<p>April 15 is the deadline for bids, he said. Results would be announced the same day.</p>
<p>The wheat would be ready for shipment in June. The official said partial offers would be considerated and partial shipments allowed.</p>
</text>
